TY  - GEN
TI  - NEVER take internally – Causes severe toxicity including: Vomiting, diarrhea, gastroenteritis Cardiac arrhythmias Liver damage Muscle weakness, collapse Death in severe cases
ER  - 

TY  - GEN
TI  - NEVER apply to: Open wounds Broken skin Mucous membranes Eyes
ER  - 

TY  - GEN
TI  - Discontinue if: Skin irritation develops Rash or eczema appears Blistering occurs
ER  - 

TY  - GEN
TI  - Contraindications: Allergy to Asteraceae family (ragweed, chrysanthemums, marigolds) Pregnancy and breastfeeding (insufficient safety data)
ER  - 

TY  - GEN
TI  - Duration: Do not use for more than 2 weeks continuously
